[[File:Aberrant spectre icon.png|left]]
'''Deviant spectres''' are stronger variants of [[aberrant spectre]]s that require level 60 [[Slayer]] to kill, and completion of [[Priest in Peril]] to receive as a [[Slayer task]]. They are found exclusively within the [[Catacombs of Kourend]].

Like aberrant spectres, a [[nose peg]] or [[Slayer helmet]] is required when fighting them; without either, their attacks will always hit and drain your combat stats extremely quickly. They are also aggressive to players in their vicinity, meaning that protective gear is highly recommended even if only passing by.  

They have a high natural health regeneration, restoring 1 hitpoint every 5 ticks, so it is more efficient to kill a single deviant spectre at a time than to alternate between multiple targets.

They are susceptible to the effects of the [[salve amulet]] and its variants; note that the Slayer helmet's effects do not stack with the salve amulet. Due to their frequent drops of seeds and grimy herbs, a [[herb sack]] and [[seed box]] are recommended when killing them.

